      en: ["The highest peak of Beljanica reaches an elevation of 1,339 meters.", "The name Beljanica refers to the white (beli) limestone rocks of the mountain.", "The mountain hosts Central Serbia's largest virgin forest complex, Vinatovača.", "The Krupaj Spring at the mountain's foot is a national natural monument.", "The Resava River forms spectacular waterfalls, such as Veliki Buk.", "The mountain is a hub for alpinism and speleology in Serbia."],
